config BR2_PACKAGE_DIRECTFB_MIPS
    bool "DirectFB (LilSmokeOS framebuffer-only build)"
    default y if BR2_PACKAGE_LILSMOKE_OS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_DIRECTFB
    help
      Wrapper that enables Buildroot's stock DirectFB package with
      LilSmokeOS-specific overrides:
        - fbdev-only (no X11, no OpenGL/GLES, no multi-app core)
        - FreeType + libpng support
        - No SDL backend inside DirectFB (we use SDL2 on top)

      This is the 2D rendering layer that SDL2 sits on top of. Without
      it, SDL2 cannot create windows on the framebuffer.

      For real hardware (SF3000/GB350), J1+ will add patches that:
        - Force the E3100's specific fbdev pixel format (BGRA, 32bpp)
        - Disable unused font drivers (saves ~600 KB RSS)
        - Disable multi-application core (saves another ~400 KB)
